	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z2"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Miseras proxime ad me literas addita copia epistolę <persName ref="p1753">Leonis</persName> ad confratrem meum <persName ref="p8412">Megandrum</persName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1"><persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Brief an <persName ref="p1391">Haller</persName> ist nicht erhalten. Die (undatierte) Abschrift des Briefes von <persName ref="p1753">Jud</persName> an <persName ref="p8412">Megander</persName> (von der Hand <persName ref="p8364">Beat Gerings</persName>) findet sich in Zürich StA, E II 381, 1803r.-1804r.</note>, charissime <lb xml:id="p1z3"/><persName ref="p495">Heinrice</persName><note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>vor</hi> <persName ref="p495">Heinrice</persName> <hi>gestrichenes</hi> Huld[rice].</note>, quas ut receperim et quando, omnino videtur opere pretium ut scias.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">17. ianuarii <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>venerat minister ille <placeName ref="l760">Salodori</placeName> amandatus<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Bei dem aus <placeName ref="l760">Solothurn</placeName> ausgewiesenen Pfarrer handelt es sich wohl um den auch unten <ref target="file10555">Nr. 519</ref>, 50. 57f und <ref target="file10560">Nr. 524</ref>, 37-39 als Bote genannten, im übrigen unbekannten Verwandten <persName ref="p8412">Meganders</persName>.</note> adferens tuam et <persName ref="p1753">Leonis</persName> ad nos omnes epistolam<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Oben <ref target="file10540">Nr. 504</ref> bzw. <ref target="file10538">Nr. 502</ref>.</note>, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>deinde etiam <persName ref="p1753">Leonis</persName> ad <persName ref="p8412">Megandrum</persName>.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Has cum simul legissemus, 19. redditę sunt tuę ad me<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b">ad me <hi>am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note> cum <persName ref="p1753">Leonis</persName> apographo, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>sed apertę et abraso titulo <persName ref="p8412">Megandro</persName>.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Is mihi, ut erant nimirum et sibi datę, reddidit.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Subinde <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>vereor, ne et tibi et mihi succenseat et suspicetur, quid tandem nos agamus.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Vellem, inquam, talem suspitionem <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>(si qua sit) a corde illius evulsam ac ut plane sciret, cur admodum inter nos conveniat.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Tu interim <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>curabis, ne <persName ref="p1753">Leo</persName> - mihi alioqui charissimus - et tibi quoque indignetur, quod suarum copiam ad me miseris.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Scio, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>quam se mutuo hi duo hactenus amarint, ut nec hac nec ulla facile dissipentur epistola, nobis siquidem <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>optime inter nos convenit.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Praeterea non ignoro, qua integritate <persName ref="p8412">Caspar</persName><pb type="edition" next="77"/><note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4"><persName ref="p8412">Kaspar Megander</persName>.</note> mecum omnia egerit hoc sane negocio.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z12"/>Quare summopere curandum, ut nulla inter nos tam levi causa simultas dissęminetur.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Dolui certe et noctes <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>duxi insomnes timens, ne sęminarium fiant literae hae tam fraudulenter apertę futurae inimicicię <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>inter nos omnes.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Age igitur, charissime <persName ref="p495">Heinrice</persName>, ut ab utroque veniam impetrem.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Nam si non fuissent <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>nescio cuius fraude interceptę, apertae tandemque <persName ref="p8412">Megandro</persName> redditę, nullus unquam mortalium a me ext<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>orsisset, sed bona fide, ut volebas, remisissem.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Facile <persName ref="p8412">Megandro</persName> et <persName ref="p1753">Leoni</persName> inter se conveniet, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>modo tibi et <persName ref="p1753">Leoni</persName> identidem.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Pro tua itaque prudentia et humanitate omnia hęc eluas, et de nobis om<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>nibus optime quemadmodum et nos de vobis sperate.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Ultima ianuarii anno 35.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z19"/>Tuus <persName ref="p1391">Berch. Hall.</persName></s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/><persName ref="p495">Heinrico Bul<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>lingero</persName>, fratri <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>suo charissimo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
